WEBVTT

00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:01.819
"Kama unataka kushindana na kushinada
karika uchumi wa kimataifa,

00:03:01.843 --> 00:03:03.311
enda chuo"

00:03:03.776 --> 00:03:06.750
"Mapato yako yanalingana na masomo yako"

00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:09.125
"Utafaulu ukijaribu"

00:03:10.327 --> 00:03:16.216
Hawa wasomi hawazingatii tusi 
fiche kwenye huu ushauri.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.125
Usipoenda chuo,

00:03:19.149 --> 00:03:22.645
usiponawiri kwenye huu uchumi mpya,

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:25.292
basi shida ni lako.

00:03:25.819 --> 00:03:27.493
Huo ndio sababu.

00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:33.500
Si ajabu wafanyikzi wengi
waligeukia ustahi wa wasomi.